/**
 * Start buying a plan (Stripe Checkout)
 *
 * Owners, admins and billing admins. Opens a Stripe Checkout session with automatic tax, tax ids and the billing address; the console redirects to `url`. Monthly plans are billed per active person in arrears; yearly plans are bought for the people active now (at least one). 409 while a subscription is running (change its plan instead), 400 for Free or Enterprise (sold on quote).
 */
